          "worked": "Let the missing fraction be $F$. Multiplying the given equation by $F$ gives\n$$\\begin{align*}F&=\\frac{1}{x}\\times\\frac{x-1}{2}\\\\&=\\frac{x-1}{2x}\\end{align*}$$",
